licenses and notices remain under fixtures/licenses and in fetched source distributions.

fixtures/reference/auxiliary-scripts contains original synthetic auxiliary CBOR with decoder and
script-validity observations from unchanged released Haskell ledger APIs. This API corpus makes no
signed transaction-admission claim. Original Apache-2.0 observer/generation code; upstream package
licenses/notices remain under fixtures/licenses and in fetched source distributions. No signing keys.

fixtures/reference/ntc-wallet-peers-11.1.3 retains original cardano-node 11.1.3 query replies,
